  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Banco Nacional de Costa Rica - Blue Bond</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Project involves issuing blue bonds for up to US$50 million in debt securities in Costa Rica for Banco Nacional de Costa Rica (hereinafter, &#x201c;Banco Nacional&#x201d;, &#x201c;BNCR&#x201d;, the &#x201c;Bank&#x201d; or the &#x201c;Issuer&#x201d;). BNCR may issue unsecured, theme (blue), ordinary, subordinated bonds. The issuance will break down as follows: (i) IDB Invest may subscribe up to US$25 million; and (ii) additional local and international co-investors may subscribe bonds for up to US$25 million.The proceeds will be used to expand the Bank&#x2019;s blue portfolio. The use of funds will allow the issuance to be categorized as &#x201c;blue&#x201d; under the International Capital Market Association (&#x201c;ICMA&#x201d;) thematic bonds principles.</narrative>
  </description>
